<title>UK: Cia Hering sets $100 mln 8-yr bond.</title>
<headline>Cia Hering sets $100 mln 8-yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Deutsche Morgan Grenfell and Marka Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   COMPANHIA HERING</p>
<p> AMT    $100 MLN	COUPON     12.0	MATURITY  * 16.OCT.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.818    PAY DATE    16.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.25	REOFFER    99.818    SPREAD	+550</p>
<p> NOTES    * CALL AT PAR AT 3 AND 5 YEARS. PUT AT 98.25 PCT AFTER</p>
<p>		3 YEARS, AT 98.75 AFTER FIVE YEARS</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 10-50-100 SALE LIMITS US/UK/BR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  BRAZIL    TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.375     SELL CONC  0.875     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND THREE-YEAR U.S. TREASURY NOTE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
